  "post_content": "<p>El alcalde de Onda, Salvador Aguilella, la teniente de alcalde de Cultura y Educaci&oacute;n, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu, el intendente principal de la Polic&iacute;a Local, Jos&eacute; Ignacio Esparza, y la coordinadora de educaci&oacute;n vial de la Jefatura Provincial de Tr&aacute;fico, Mar&iacute;a Jes&uacute;s S&aacute;nchez Herr&aacute;ez,&nbsp;<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none\">&nbsp;</span>han clausurado a mediod&iacute;a de hoy una nueva edici&oacute;n de las jornadas de educaci&oacute;n vial, en la que han participado escolares de la ciudad.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0710.jpg\" alt=\"img_0710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0711.jpg\" alt=\"img_0711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0712.jpg\" alt=\"img_0712\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0713.jpg\" alt=\"img_0713\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0714.jpg\" alt=\"img_0714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0715.jpg\" alt=\"img_0715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0716.jpg\" alt=\"img_0716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesseguretatvialicloenda/img_0717.jpg\" alt=\"img_0717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src